      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Relying on water and ibuprofen to counter MAOI tyramine reactions is dangerous because these measures cannot prevent a life-threatening hypertensive crisis, and ibuprofen may also interact negatively with your medication. MAOI safety guidelines strictly advise against consuming tyramine-rich foods while on this specific class of antidepressants because no simple recovery method exists if a reaction occurs. Please consult your healthcare provider immediately to confirm if your specific prescription allows for any leniency regarding these foods before you risk your health.",
